Every nonopioid-pharmacologic-therapy relates to a nonopioid-therapy-risk.
If a patient is an older-adult then every nonopioid-pharmacologic-therapy particularly relates to a nonopioid-therapy-risk for the patient.
If a patient is a pregnant-patient then every nonopioid-pharmacologic-therapy particularly relates to a nonopioid-therapy-risk for the patient.
If a patient has a cardiovascular-disease then every nonopioid-pharmacologic-therapy particularly relates to a nonopioid-therapy-risk for the patient.
If a patient has a renal-disease then every nonopioid-pharmacologic-therapy particularly relates to a nonopioid-therapy-risk for the patient.
If a patient has a gastrointestinal-disease then every nonopioid-pharmacologic-therapy particularly relates to a nonopioid-therapy-risk for the patient.
If a patient has a liver-disease then every nonopioid-pharmacologic-therapy particularly relates to a nonopioid-therapy-risk for the patient.
